  <main>
    <div class="container hero">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow"><span></span> Your all-in-one creative AI studio</div>
        <h1>Make your next big idea <span class="gradient-text">real.</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-copy">
          Build beautiful websites, create AI images, and turn your ideas into video.
          One simple studio for everything you want to make.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <button class="button" data-demo>Start creating free <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
          <a class="button secondary" href="#services">Explore the tools</a>
        </div>
        <p class="offer-note">One free credit on your <strong>first login</strong>. No recurring free offer.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="visual" aria-label="3D-inspired AI creation preview">
        <div class="glow"></div>
        <div class="orbit"><i class="orb"></i></div>
        <div class="orbit two"><i class="orb purple"></i></div>
        <div class="showcase">
          <div class="showcase-top">
            <div class="window-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
            <span>NOVA CREATIVE CANVAS</span>
            <span>•••</span>
          </div>
          <div class="art"><span class="art-label">AI IMAGE · CINEMATIC SERIES</span></div>
          <h3>Ideas, meet imagination.</h3>
          <p>Generate. Refine. Create something unforgettable.</p>
          <div class="mini-tools">
            <span>✦ Image</span><span>▶ Video</span><span>⌘ Website</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section id="services">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <div class="eyebrow"><span></span> Everything you need to create</div>
          <h2>One studio. <span class="gradient-text">Four ways to make.</span></h2>
          <p>Start with a blank page or a simple prompt. Bring your next idea to life with tools made for creators.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="services">
          <article class="service-card">
            <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">⌘</div>
            <h3>Website creation</h3>
            <p>Create a polished website for your brand, portfolio, or business—without starting from scratch.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="service-card">
            <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">✦</div>
            <h3>AI creation</h3>
            <p>Turn a prompt into fresh ideas and creative content, then refine it to fit your style.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="service-card">
            <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">◉</div>
            <h3>AI photos</h3>
            <p>Generate original images and visual concepts for projects, campaigns, and social content.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="service-card">
            <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">▶</div>
            <h3>AI video</h3>
            <p>Make video concepts from your ideas and create engaging visuals ready for your workflow.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="how">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <div class="eyebrow"><span></span> Simple by design</div>
          <h2>From idea to <span class="gradient-text">finished creation.</span></h2>
          <p>No complicated setup. Pick a tool, describe what you want, and start creating.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="steps">
          <article class="step">
            <div class="step-number">STEP 01</div>
            <h3>Choose your tool</h3>
            <p>Select website creation, AI creation, photos, or video—whatever your idea needs.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="step">
            <div class="step-number">STEP 02</div>
            <h3>Describe your idea</h3>
            <p>Write a prompt or choose a starting point. You can iterate and refine your results.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="step">
            <div class="step-number">STEP 03</div>
            <h3>Create and share</h3>
            <p>Use your creation in your project and choose a paid plan when you need more credits.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="pricing">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="pricing-wrap">
          <div class="pricing-content">
            <div>
              <div class="eyebrow"><span></span> A simple way to get started</div>
              <h2>Your first creation is on us.</h2>
