              <div class="check-list">
                <span>One-time first-login credit</span>
                <span>Explore the creative tools</span>
                <span>Upgrade when you’re ready</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="price">Free <small>one time</small></div>
              <button class="button" data-demo>Claim free credit →</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="faq">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <div class="eyebrow"><span></span> Questions, answered</div>
          <h2>Good to <span class="gradient-text">know.</span></h2>
        </div>
        <div class="faq">
          <details>
            <summary>What does the first-login offer include?</summary>
            <p>New users receive one free credit the first time they log in. It is a one-time offer per account.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Are the tools free to use forever?</summary>
            <p>No. The free credit is a one-time trial. Continued use is intended to be available through paid plans.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Can I create websites, images, and videos?</summary>
            <p>Yes. The page presents all four services: website creation, AI creation, AI photos, and AI video.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Can I sign up or pay on this demo page?</summary>
            <p>Not yet. This page is a front-end design; signup, payment, and AI generation need to be connected to backend services.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="container footer-inner">
      <a class="brand" href="#"><span class="brand-mark">✦</span><span>NOVA<span class="gradient-text">STUDIO</span></span></a>
      <span>© <span id="year"></span> NOVA Studio. Create something amazing.</span>
      <span>Terms · Privacy</span>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <div class="toast" id="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite">
    Demo button: connect signup and account credits to enable this action.
  </div>

  <script>
    const menuButton = document.getElementById("menuButton");
    const navLinks = document.getElementById("navLinks");
    const toast = document.getElementById("toast");
    let toastTimer;

    menuButton.addEventListener("click", () => {
      const isOpen = navLinks.classList.toggle("open");
      menuButton.setAttribute("aria-expanded", String(isOpen));
      menuButton.setAttribute("aria-label", isOpen ? "Close navigation" : "Open navigation");
    });

    navLinks.querySelectorAll("a").forEach((link) => {
      link.addEventListener("click", () => {
        navLinks.classList.remove("open");
        menuButton.setAttribute("aria-expanded", "false");
      });
    });

    document.querySelectorAll("[data-demo]").forEach((button) => {
      button.addEventListener("click", () => {
        toast.classList.add("show");
        clearTimeout(toastTimer);
        toastTimer = setTimeout(() => toast.classList.remove("show"), 3500);
      });
    });

    document.getElementById("year").textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
